          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Increasing the RRF rank constant flattens relative differences between high and low ranks. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/reciprocal-rank-fusion",
          "note": null,
