          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elasticsearch requires a fixed rank window for stable RRF pagination; changing that window can change previously seen ordering. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-22)",
          "source": "https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/reciprocal-rank-fusion",
