          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Exact-term matching depends on indexed field analysis; Elasticsearch's standard text analyzer removes most punctuation and lowercases tokens. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-22)",
          "source": "https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/query-languages/query-dsl/query-dsl-term-query",
